---
import Base from "../components/Base.astro";
import Ornament from "../components/Ornament.astro";
import Picture from "../components/Picture.astro";
---

<Base title="About Tara" description="Who Tara is, what she is planning and what is still to be filled in.">
  <header class="page-head">
    <p class="kicker dark">About</p>
    <h1 class="script">About Tara</h1>
    <Ornament />
  </header>

  <section class="split" id="creator">
    <figure class="split-photo">
      <Picture name="creator-flatlay" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 40vw, 100vw" />
      <figcaption class="quiet">AI-generated illustration of a creator's desk. Not a photograph of Tara.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="split-copy prose-left">
      <h2 class="script">A bride with a plan</h2>
      <p>
        Tara is planning to marry in about two years, and she is planning three celebrations: one in India, one in Italy
        and one in America. She is multi-ethnic, of Indian descent.
      </p>
      <p>
        By day she works in business and care coordination, which means a lot of juggling people, schedules and
        information. Wedding planning asks for the same muscles, so the plan is to document it with the same care.
      </p>
      <p>
        The goal of this site is to grow into a bridal creator project: honest notes, outfit hunts and budget diaries,
        and, over time, partnerships that help pay for the dress and the planning. Everything will be labeled as it
        becomes real.
      </p>
      <p class="todo">[Tara: add a short personal note here, in your own words. Hometown, family, how you met your partner and anything else you want to share.]</p>
      <p><a class="orn-btn" href="/weddings">
        <i class="gem a"></i><i class="gem b"></i><i class="gem c"></i><i class="gem d"></i>
        The three weddings
      </a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" id="facts">
    <div class="band-inner">
      <h2 class="script">Facts, and what is still blank</h2>
      <Ornament />
      <div class="fact-grid">
        <div>
          <h3>Known so far</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Name: Tara</li>
            <li>Planning to marry in about two years</li>
            <li>Works in business and care coordination</li>
            <li>Multi-ethnic, of Indian descent</li>
            <li>Planning three celebrations: India, Italy and America</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Tara to fill in</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Last name or public name, if different</li>
            <li>Location and hometown</li>
            <li>Partner's name and how much to share about them</li>
            <li>Dates, venues and guest counts</li>
            <li>Social handles and a real contact address</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section prose-block" id="disclosures">
    <h2 class="script">What this preview is</h2>
    <Ornament />
    <p>
      This is a draft preview. It is not indexed by search engines. Every image on it is an AI-generated illustration, not a
      photograph of Tara, her family or any real venue. There are no accounts, no payments, no tracking and no products for
      sale. The "partnership" packages are examples only. When real sponsorships or affiliate links exist, they will be
      labeled where they appear.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
